# Repository-root environment file.
#
# Copy to `.env` and fill in the value. Both the Express API and the Python
# science worker read this file, so the credential lives in exactly one place.
#
# This key is only ever sent to api.nasa.gov. The two primary data sources —
# NASA/IPAC IRSA and the NASA JPL Solar System Dynamics APIs — are open and
# need no credential at all, so the platform works without this key; only the
# NeoWs near-Earth-object lookup is unavailable.
#
# Get a free key at https://api.nasa.gov. `DEMO_KEY` also works for light use.
NASA_API_KEY=YOUR_NASA_API_KEY_HERE
